  "_comment_purpose": "BUG-LOCAL-129 settling experiment: feed HuMo the radio_bookend png directly as ref_image (bypassing OTR_BatchHumoRender's never-humo guards). Renders ONE clip, ~1.3 s @ 25 fps. Purpose: empirically verify the round-robin reviewer's claim that HuMo's face-only behavior is in the WEIGHTS, not the conditioning code -- if a non-face ref still produces a face here, it's confirmed; if it produces something radio-like, BUG-129b is over-conservative.",
